### Успешное создание проекта 201 Created (Ошибка 409: Дубликат проекта - запустите дважды для проверки)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/project/project
Content-Type: application/json
X-Telegram-User-Id: 123456789
X-Telegram-Username: llllqqqqqqqqq
X-User-Roles: STUDENT

{
  "github_repository_url": "https://github.com/zhukovsd/currency-exchange-test",
  "programming_language": "Java",
  "roadmap_project": "CURRENCY-EXCHANGE",
  "deployment_url": "http://example-deploy.ru/"
}

